routed at 85.881, 86.637, and 86.637 MHz with 4,129 LUT4s and 894 registers. The 86.637 MHz median clears the 80.49 MHz replacement threshold and yields 191.35 iterations/s, 12.59% above the champion.\n- Execute feedback is the worst path at all three placements. At placement option 0, the quotient-to-EX/MEM divide path has a reported arrival of 16.937 ns, within 0.001 ns of the worst path.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
