locks. The eight extra cycles leave one cycle for a preceding load-use or redirect bubble within the unchanged ten-cycle liveness window when both buses are ready.\\n\\nHold fetch and ID/EX until the divide result can transfer and let older memory and writeback work drain. Issue only when the older MEM transaction can advance, insert EX/MEM bubbles while waiting and transfer the saved instruction and result exactly once. Report the captured source operands in RVFI and make the completed result available to the next instruction through normal EX/MEM forwarding. Base integer and multiply i\n…[45740 of 48812 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:08c05c31a10478f7]…\niming can still limit the score.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 5, 'confidence': 'low'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/core_pkg.sv', 'description': 'Define the predecoded load lane descriptor and carry the byte relations and leading relation in the deferred branch packet.'}, {'file': 'rtl/ex_stage.sv', 'description': \"Calculate and register the load's lane selects while generating its effective address. Compare the raw response lane by lane for a deferred branch.\"}, {'file': 'rtl/core.sv', 'description': 'Connect the raw data word, registered load descriptor and qualified load indication to the deferred branch path.'}, {'file': 'rtl/mem_stage.sv', 'description': 'Gather writeback bytes with the registered selects and resolve deferred branches from the registered raw-lane predicates.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Cover each legal lane for signed and unsigned loads and comparisons, extension boundaries, either source position, double matches, and stalled and trapping loads.'}]}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
