lled, including an older held dmem request and a target JAL or dependent instruction. Check continuous RVFI PCs, precise misalignment traps, wrong-path store exclusion, the registered JALR redirect, and the tightened direct JAL-to-REMU gap while retaining the divide and load-use bounds.\\\"\nEND_HYPOTHESIS\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
