ss both parities. Exercise a target miss and retry, a full queue, and correction concurrent with a primed target. Check retirement order, exact successor PCs, and wrong-path side effects.\nYAML\nsed -i 's/\"'^ $//'\"' cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261123-003-r14s2.yaml\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json,yaml\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom jsonschema import validate\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261123-003-r14s2.yaml')\nx=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nvalidate(x,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nassert x['id']==p.stem and x['category']=='predictor'\nprint(f'{p} passed schema validation')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "sed: preserving permissions for ‘cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/sedA8yWAn’: Invalid argument\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261123-003-r14s2.yaml passed schema validation\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
