{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"The first prototype kept nearly all the cycle savings at 4,223,158 timed cycles, but its 78.151 MHz median fell short of the roughly 85.9 MHz needed. The slowest path ran through fetch recovery selection. I’ll test whether keeping one registered fetch PC and validating the prediction with fewer bits improves timing."}}
{"type": "item.started", "item": {"id": "item_27", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c 'cd \"$TMPDIR/predictor-r6s2.QecCvZ56\"\ncp -r rtl_page rtl_single_pc\npython3 - <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ndef edit(name, old, new):\n    path = Path(\\\"rtl_single_pc\\\") / name\n    src = path.read_text()\n    assert old in src, old\n    path.write_text(src.replace(old, new, 1))\n\nedit(\\\"core.sv\\\", \\\"  predictor_update_t update_ex, update_q;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  predictor_update_t update_ex, update_q;\n  logic predicted_taken;\n  logic [9:0] predicted_offset;\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"core.sv\\\", \\\"    .update          (update_q),\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"    .update          (update_q),\n    .predicted_taken (predicted_taken),\n    .predicted_offset(predicted_offset),\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"core.sv\\\", \\\"    .fetch_pc        (if_id_w.pc),\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"    .predicted_taken (predicted_taken),\n    .predicted_offset(predicted_offset),\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"ex_stage.sv\\\", \\\"  input  logic [31:0]        fetch_pc,\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  input  logic               predicted_taken,\n  input  logic [9:0]         predicted_offset,\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"ex_stage.sv\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  assign recovery_taken = transfer_advance && target_selected && (fetch_pc \"'!= redirect_target);\n  assign recovery_seq = transfer_advance && !target_selected && (fetch_pc != redirect_seq);\"\"\", \"\"\"  assign recovery_taken = transfer_advance && target_selected\n                        && (!predicted_taken || !local_target\n                             || (predicted_offset != redirect_target[11:2]));\n  assign recovery_seq = transfer_advance && !target_selected && predicted_taken;\"\"\")\nedit(\"if_stage.sv\", \"  output logic [31:0]       imem_addr,\", \"\"\"  output logic              predicted_taken,\n  output logic [9:0]        predicted_offset,\n  output logic [31:0]       imem_addr,\"\"\")\nedit(\"if_stage.sv\", \"\"\"  logic [31:0] pc, target_q, sequence_q;\n  logic normal_q, recovery_taken_q, recovery_seq_q;\n  logic [31:0] fetch_pc, sequential_pc;\"\"\", \"\"\"  logic [31:2] pc;\n  logic [10:0] sequential_word;\n  logic [19:0] sequential_page;\n  logic redirect, hit, advance_page;\"\"\")\nedit(\"if_stage.sv\", \"\"\"  logic legal_control, take_prediction, advance_seq;\n\n  assign fetch_pc = ({32{normal_q}} & pc)\n                  | ({32{recovery_taken_q}} & target_q)\n                  | ({32{recovery_seq_q}} & sequence_q);\n  assign sequential_pc = fetch_pc + 32'\"'d4;\n  assign {lookup_tag, lookup_index} = fetch_pc[11:2];\\\"\\\"\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  logic legal_control;\n\n  assign sequential_word = {1'b0, pc[11:2]} + 11'd1;\n  assign sequential_page = pc[31:12] + 20'd1;\n  assign {lookup_tag, lookup_index} = pc[11:2];\n  assign redirect = recovery_taken || recovery_seq;\n  assign predicted_offset = pc[11:2];\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"if_stage.sv\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  assign take_prediction = \"'!stall && legal_control && (|bank_hit);\n  assign advance_seq = !stall && !(legal_control && (|bank_hit));\"\"\", \"\"\"  assign hit = legal_control && (|bank_hit);\n  assign advance_page = !stall && !hit && sequential_word[10];\"\"\")\nedit(\"if_stage.sv\", \"\"\"  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin\n    recovery_taken_q <= !reset && recovery_taken;\n    recovery_seq_q <= !reset && recovery_seq;\n    normal_q <= reset || !(recovery_taken || recovery_seq);\n    target_q <= redirect_target;\n    sequence_q <= redirect_seq;\n\n    if (reset) pc <= 32'\"'b0;\n    else pc <= ({32{stall}} & fetch_pc)\n             | ({32{advance_seq}} & sequential_pc)\n             | ({32{take_prediction}} & {fetch_pc[31:12], target_offset, 2'b00});\n  end\n\n  assign imem_addr = fetch_pc;\n  assign out.pc = fetch_pc;\\\"\\\"\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin\n    if (reset) begin\n      pc <= '0;\n      predicted_taken <= 1'b0;\n    end else if (redirect) begin\n      pc <= ({30{recovery_taken}} & redirect_target[31:2])\n          | ({30{recovery_seq}} & redirect_seq[31:2]);\n      predicted_taken <= 1'b0;\n    end else if (\"'!stall) begin\n      pc[11:2] <= hit ? target_offset : sequential_word[9:0];\n      predicted_taken <= hit;\n      if (advance_page) pc[31:12] <= sequential_page;\n    end\n  end\n\n  assign imem_addr = {pc, 2'\"'b00};\n  assign out.pc = imem_addr;\\\"\\\"\\\")\n# Both addresses have bits 1:0 known zero whenever selected.\nedit(\\\"if_stage.sv\\\", \\\"  input  logic [31:0]       redirect_target,\\\\n  input  logic [31:0]       redirect_seq,\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  input  logic [31:2]       redirect_target,\n  input  logic [31:2]       redirect_seq,\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"core.sv\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"    .redirect_target (redirect_target),\n    .redirect_seq    (redirect_sequential),\n    .update          (update_q),\\\"\\\"\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"    .redirect_target (redirect_target[31:2]),\n    .redirect_seq    (redirect_sequential[31:2]),\n    .update          (update_q),\\\"\\\"\\\")\nedit(\\\"core.sv\\\", \\\"  logic [31:0] redirect_target, redirect_sequential;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  /* verilator lint_off UNUSEDSIGNAL */\n  logic [31:0] redirect_target, redirect_sequential;\n  /* verilator lint_on UNUSEDSIGNAL */\\\"\\\"\\\")\nPY\nworkroot=\\\"\"'$OLDPWD\"\nverilator --cc --exe --build -j 4 --top-module core --Mdir obj_single_pc -CFLAGS '\"'-DNRET=1' -Wall +incdir+rtl_single_pc rtl_single_pc/core_pkg.sv rtl_single_pc/*.sv \\\"\"'$workroot/test/cosim/main.cpp\" > single-pc-build.log 2>&1 &&\n  obj_single_pc/Vcore bench/programs/coremark.elf 6000000 --bench --istall --dstall > single-pc.jsonl\nout_status=$?\ntail -n 6 single-pc-build.log\nif test \"$out_status\" = 0; then tail -n 1 single-pc.jsonl; fi\nexit \"$out_status\"'", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": null, "status": "in_progress"}}
